      "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request addresses an inconsistency in `fully_async_rollouter.py` where the calculation of `total_rollout_steps` used `trainer.total_epochs` while the epoch loop used `rollout.total_epochs`. This could lead to premature termination of experiments. The change correctly updates the `total_rollout_steps` calculation to use `rollout.total_epochs`, ensuring consistency and correct behavior. The fix is accurate and resolves the described issue.",
